{'symbol': 'MS', 'date': '2021-10-06 10:00:00', 'title': "MORGAN STANLEY ALLIANCE FOR CHILDREN'S MENTAL HEALTH ANNOUNCES FIVE WINNERS OF THE INAUGURAL INNOVATION AWARDS", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MORGAN STANLEY TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FIVE WINNERS OF THE INAUGURAL ALLIANCE FOR CHILDREN'S MENTAL HEALTH INNOVATION AWARDS, ITS NATIONWIDE CALL TO SUPPORT TRANSFORMATIVE SOLUTIONS THAT ADDRESS ADVERSE MENTAL HEALTH OUTCOMES FOR CHILDREN AND YOUNG PEOPLE ACROSS THE U.S. THE PROGRAM WILL AWARD THE FINALISTS A TOTAL OF $500,000 IN GRANTS TO HELP SCALE THEIR SOLUTIONS, AND PROVIDE CONSULTATION AND A SHOWCASE OPPORTUNITY ON NOVEMBER 11. THE FIVE FINALISTS WERE SELECTED AFTER"}